{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35870","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 八 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"还淳反朴已难期，依德依仁敢暂违。\n寡欲自应刚正立，无私翻觉友朋稀。\n旄头影莫侵黄道，傅说星终近紫微。\n年纪少他蘧伯玉，幸因多难早知非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}